      "answer": 0,
      "solution": "Latus rectum of $y^2=4x$ is $x=1$. Area $=2\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 2\\sqrt x\\,dx=4\\cdot\\dfrac23=\\dfrac{8}{3}$.",
